      "message": "I recommend NOT initializing these variables so that we can detect this kind of bug in `av1_return_max_sub_pixel_mv and av1_return_min_sub_pixel_mv`. Please see my comment at line 279 below.",
      "revId": "ee28c02bb2106089da36ddd60642ca9f90bde37e",
